# Implementation Plan - Stabilizing End-to-End Pipeline

The primary goal is to resolve the `Failed to fetch` error (CORS mismatch) and make the current "Upload -> Restore -> Profile" flow functional and visible in the UI.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **CORS Configuration**: I will broaden the allowed origins in the backend to include `localhost:3000` through `localhost:3010` to prevent future port-jumping issues on Ubuntu.
> **Sequential Flow**: The UI will automatically trigger the "Restore" and "Profile" steps after a successful upload, providing a seamless "one-click" experience while keeping the user informed of each stage.

